{
  "name": "codenames-darkline-protocol",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "機密代碼：暗線任務 (Codenames: Darkline Protocol) - 現代情報中心風格網頁桌遊，支援單人 AI、多人即時連線與人機混合組隊",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
